Mr. Chheng Monira, Chbar Ampov District Governor, said that the Prek Pra Canal is an important drainage canal in Chbar Ampov District, but this canal was violated and people lived on the canal, which caused a blockage in the waterway. Regarding this issue, Mr. Khuong Sreng advised the district authorities to solve it so that the people can move out of the Prek Pra canal voluntarily.
