Ratanakkiri Joint Police Force Continues to Inspect Hundreds of Hectares of State Forest Land in Kon Mom District
(Ratanakkiri): Mr. Khan Chamnan, Deputy Governor of the province, on January 29, 2024, continued to inspect several state forest lands with hundreds of hectares of land encroached upon and burned for ownership. The forest land was encroached upon and burned at the lower Oka point (SK land extension) in Ton commune, Kon Mom district, bordering Hat Pak commune, Vern Sai district.
