The examination, which took place at the National Institute of Physical Education and Sports, was attended by stakeholders from the Ministry of Public Works, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, the Anti-Corruption Unit and the Ministry of Health. While security and order are well ensured. This is according to Mr. Sok Sabayna.
He said that according to the plan for the practice test will end on the morning of February 5, 2024. After announcing the official results, the commission also gave the candidates a week to protest the results they received in case they found any irregularities.
