The meeting was held under the theme "ASEAN: Strengthening Connectivity and Resilience", discussing priorities and key achievements under the ASEAN Chairmanship of the Lao People's Democratic Republic for 2024.
The ASEAN Foreign Ministers also reviewed the work following the 43rd ASEAN Summit and related summits, as well as discussed ways to build the ASEAN Community, including the progress of the ASEAN Community Vision 2045. The ASEAN Foreign Ministers also exchanged views on ASEAN's external relations as well as regional and international issues of common interest and concern.
During the meeting, the Deputy Prime Minister also had a program of bilateral talks with some ASEAN counterparts to expand mutually beneficial cooperation within the bilateral and multilateral frameworks.
