Cambodia-China Friendship Radio Citizens erupt in protest of the state canal project to use the land to build a road for the people, but still sell the land to a private company in Kampong Ror district, Svay Rieng province
(Svay Rieng): Many families erupted in protest regarding the project to restore a state canal to use the land to build a road for people to travel, but still sell this land to a private company Back.
The protest erupted on the afternoon of January 27, 2024 in Roth village, Khseth commune, Kampong Ror district, Svay Rieng province.
Residents said they were protesting this afternoon because authorities had not kept their promise to take state land to build a canal on the back of a five-meter-long canal more than five kilometers long and allow the company to dig. Take the land of the state canal and pour it to a private company.
