Senior Minister Ly Thuch chairs a meeting to prepare for the Siem Reap-Angkor Summit on a Mine-Free World of the Ottawa Convention and the Preparation of the Siem Reap-Angkor Statement and Action Plan
(Switzerland): On January 26, 2024, in Geneva, Switzerland, Senior Minister Ly Thuch, First Deputy Chairman of the Mine Authority and Chair of the Fifth Review Meeting of the 2024 Ottawa Convention, chaired a meeting with stakeholders. To prepare for the 5th Review Meeting of the Ottawa Convention in Siem Reap 2024 and to prepare the Siem Reap-Angkor Statement and Action Plan for 5 years.
