The next five-year statement and action plan will be called the Siem Reap-Angkor Statement and the Siem Reap-Angkor Action Plan, which will be engraved in the history of the United Nations and the world. These documents are mine action oriented documents for the whole world.
Dr. Ly Thuch confirmed to the meeting that the organization of the upcoming Siem Reap-Angkor Summit in Siem Reap was highly regarded by the Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, His Majesty the King Hun Manet, and made some recommendations in the reception and reception. To the delegates around the world warmly.
