(Phnom Penh): Mr. Oeur Sothearoth, Chief Executive Officer of KREDIT Bourro Cambodia, a financial expert, said that the use of the CBC credit sharing system is very beneficial for the public, financial institutions and for the national economy as a whole. That only in Cambodia and in the world.
He said through the CBC system for customers with a good history, they will be able to get a higher loan, quick approval, as well as the best conditions.
