At the same time, he said that the presence of CBC in Cambodia has helped Cambodians to be able to access better credit, falling from 100th to seventh in the world.
Speaking at a discussion on the topic: "The effects of a bad reputation (corrupt CBC) on the use of financial institutions in Cambodia," Mr. Oeur Sothearoth said that financial services are like two weapons that customers need to use. This service is responsible and use this service to make a profit, rather than borrowing to buy other material.
