Mr. L Chinh, President of the Khmer Cassava Association, said, "As for the price of cassava at the end of 2023 and now, the price is slightly different in the region, with prices between 360 riel per kilogram for fresh cassava and dried cassava. The price is between 750-780 riel per kilogram.
