However, he said that the cultivation of cassava by the people faces some challenges because the cultivation depends on the weather, which means that the cultivation of cassava in the rainy season will start in March, but if there is no rain in March. Then planting will last until May, for a long time this will cause the seedlings to die and when to plant will have to buy seedlings from neighboring countries with high prices.
Cassava export markets are Thailand and Vietnam, while China is still small.
