In front of the supporters, after the verdict of the Constitutional Court, Pita stressed that he will continue to work for the people and return to parliament soon.
The ruling by the Thai Constitutional Court was a success for Pita, but his Move Forward party has not yet survived, as the Thai Constitutional Court is expected to hear next week. A petition alleges that the party's commitment to amending the law is an attempt to overthrow a democratic government with the king as head of state.
