The purpose of this meeting is to strengthen and enhance cooperation in the partnership and to better understand the strengths and weaknesses in the performance of the obligations of private security providers, enterprises, establishments. Implemented in the past and to increase capacity, increase effective cooperation in contributing to the maintenance of social security. This was stated by Lt. Gen. Deputy Commissioner General.
