In addition, to continue to promote and support the training of private security skills by sending area chiefs or managers and agents to receive training from the General Commission of the National Police, with the Department of Private Security Management as a staff and continue to participate in the defense. Security, safety and order of all national and international events at the request and request of the General Commission of the National Police.
