Separately, for the training of private security agents, Lt. Gen. Lim Sokharasmey emphasized that at present, a total of 56 private security agency training courses have been opened, with a total of 9,866 participants (230 females), including a total of private security agents. 9,638 (211 females) and a total of 228 national police (19 females).
