Order of Samdech President Hun Manet on the occasion of celebrating the 25th anniversary of the establishment of the Army Command on the morning of January 24, 2024.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that along with the celebration of the 25th anniversary of the Army's birthday, it is necessary to examine, recognize and remember the key to the internal unity of the army and the win-win politics that leads to Cambodia. There is unity, there is national unity until now. The President thanked the officers for going through this difficult stage.
