(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Wednesday, January 24, 2024, the 25th anniversary of the birth of King Bhumibol Adulyadej was presided over by the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Hun Manet. Establishment of the Army Command (January 24, 1999 - January 24, 2024). The ceremony was held at the Army Headquarters in a grand manner, with demonstrations of troops and tactics from various units under the Army Command.
Organizing a ceremony to commemorate the 25th anniversary of the establishment of the Army in the spirit of commemorating the noble heroism of the heroes and heroines of the Army who sacrificed in the cause of the nation, motherland and people, and continue to contribute to respect And implement the vision, political program, strategic pentagon strategy - the first phase and key measures of the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly.
The following are the main remarks of Samdech Hun Sen Manet on the occasion of celebrating the 25th anniversary of the establishment of the Army Command:
* President Hun Manet stated that the army has always linked all stages of the nation's historical events, including coups and national liberation.
* President Hun Manet stated that after the integration, without a skilled leadership mechanism, the army could not trust each other and can live in peace until now.
* President Hun Manet stated that in conjunction with the celebration of the 25th anniversary of the Army's birthday, it is important to review, recognize and remember the key to the internal unity of the army and the win-win politics that leads to Cambodia has been united and united until now.
* President Hun Manet expressed his gratitude to our officers who went through this difficult period.
* President Hun Manet stated that the biggest base is peace, security, social stability, without peace we can not develop and unite our army and our nation.
* President Hun Manet stated that this peace comes from our army, especially the army.
* President Hun Manet stated that the army has made a significant contribution to maintaining peace, building the nation and responding to disasters.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that so far, many provinces have been declared demining-safe areas under the participation of the army, in line with Samdech Techo's goal of clearing all mines by 2025.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia continues to maintain its position of sending troops to participate in peacekeeping activities under the United Nations umbrella.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the new Royal Government has set out many policies to protect the old achievements and build new achievements. The military is an important part of preserving the environment, especially maintaining peace.
* President Hun Manet told the military that peace must be maintained at all costs.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet stated that the new Royal Government has introduced many reforms to strengthen the capacity of the army. But the modernization of the army must not lose the spirit of national defense, loyalty to the nation and the people, the spirit of national defense, religion and the king, and peacekeeping.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that despite the reforms, the spirit of national prestige must not be lost.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet instructed the Army Command to continue to reform, strengthen the structure, strengthen the capacity and strength of various units.
Samdech Hun Sen directs the Army to continue research and training to respond to technological developments and the state of the world.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised to continue to strengthen the way the army works.
* President Hun Manet stated that the continuity and sustainability of the army's capabilities to the next generation is an important task.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet instructed the army to strengthen the policy of military diplomacy.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised to continue to pay attention to training to strengthen military capacity.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia has no ambition to invade any country, equipping weapons only to strengthen national defense capabilities.
* President Hun Manet stated that the development of the capabilities of the Army, Navy and Air Force has no ambition to threaten or invade any country.
(Phnom Penh): National Road No. 31 has a total length of nearly 54 km from Bek Kus (junction of National Road No. 3) to Kampong Trach district town (connection point to National Road No. 33) after the construction site in December. The year 2022 will be completed by the time of July 2024, while the construction will be completed by the end of 2024.
