Key Remarks by Samdech Hun Sen Manet on the Occasion of Closing Ceremony of the 2023 Annual Meeting and 2024 Work Orientation of the Ministry of Information
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Tuesday, January 23, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, presided over the closing ceremony of the 2023 work review meeting. And raise the work direction for 2024 of the Ministry of Information.
The Ministry of Information has been assigned by the Royal Government to direct and manage the field of information and audio-visual, including providing information and disseminating facts about Cambodia through bulletins, newspapers, magazines, photos, radio, television and electronic broadcasting, authorizing the business and management of related services. Release of audio-visual products, protection of press freedom, and cooperation with the International Press and Audiovisual Organization.
