Samdech Hun Sen praised the leadership of the new Minister of Information and expressed his gratitude to Mr. Khieu Kanharith, former Minister of Information, for his efforts in leading the field of information and training of human resources in the field of information.
* Samdech Thibodi Hun Manet expressed his support for the Ministry of Information, which has a vision to reform the information sector based on the spirit of "new, real, fast and reliable".
