Lt. Gen. Chuon Narin instructed all immigration officers to do this work in good cooperation with the Phnom Penh Municipal Unity Command to update foreigners and immigrants in a clear and strict manner in accordance with their skills and laws. Going to work must be done properly, do not do anything beyond the principles of law and skills that cause harm to investors.
On that occasion, the Lt. Gen. introduced the strengthening of effective management of digital technology databases in all 105 state police stations and training to strengthen the capacity of immigration officers to have clear knowledge on the implementation of procedures.
