Minister Peng Porna chaired a meeting of the Coordinating and Orientation Committee for Management and Implementation of Public Works and Transport Infrastructure Project
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Peng Po, Minister of Public Works and Transport and Chairman of the Commission, this morning, January 22, 2024, chaired a meeting of the Coordinating and Orientation Committee for Management and Implementation of Public Works and Transport Infrastructure Project. With the participation of the Vice President and the relevant officials as well as many other members.
The meeting was held to officially announce the composition of the project coordination committee as well as the composition of the specialized working groups in the six sections of the committee secretariat. On the other hand, the meeting raised the roles, duties and responsibilities to inform the members of the committee and the specialized working groups in each section of the Secretariat.
The Project Coordinating Committee was established by Prakas No. 308 SAK Prok dated 14 December 2023 in order to coordinate, orient and decide on the formulation of policies, principles and annual, medium and long-term development plans on Construction, restoration, repair and maintenance of public and transport infrastructure.
In addition, the Project Coordinating Committee shall promote and monitor the preparation of various plans, as well as monitor the evaluation of the effectiveness and efficiency of the implementation of work, prepare various reports and compile information on all project progress from the relevant units under Management authority of the Ministry as well.
