During the meeting, Samdech and Mr. Makrong called for further strengthening of relations between France and Cambodia in many areas of historical cooperation and sought to diversify areas in bilateral cooperation. The two sides also stressed the importance of strengthening investment and trade between the two countries and pledged to redouble efforts to boost investment and deepen bilateral economic ties.
