The event was presided over by Mr. Pech Rithy, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Commerce, on behalf of Ms. Cham Nimol, Minister of Commerce, and Dr. Devyani Khobragade, Ambassador of India to Cambodia, as well as dignitaries of the two governments, Cambodia and India, Duke Oknha, Business Leaders And other key stakeholders from the Indian-Cambodian business community on the evening of January 17, 2024 at Sofitel Phnom Penh Phokitra.
