"Cambodia is one of the most prosperous economies in Asia, with an average growth rate of 7% for more than two decades before the Kovid epidemic," she said. "After the epidemic, Cambodia's economy has recovered, growing by 5.2 percent in 2022 and 5.4 percent in 2023."
Speaking at the IBCC launch, the ambassador expressed confidence that "Cambodia is set to become a high-middle-income country by 2030. It is certain that with the initiative of the Royal Government under the leadership of Samdech Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Cambodia will set a growth rate of 7% again.
