He added that the Indian Business Council in Cambodia will provide opportunities for business people and investors to get to know members of the business community, business owners and other professionals in various fields.
The Indian Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia (IBCC) was established in 2023 by a group of Indian entrepreneurs and business leaders. The IBCC was established to promote trade and commerce between Cambodia and India and to provide a platform for networking and collaboration between Indian and Cambodian businesses.
IBCC's vision is to become a leading Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia that will support the success of Indian businesses and contribute to the Cambodian economy.
