Permanent Deputy Prime Minister Vongsey Visoth chaired an inter-ministerial meeting to review and discuss the draft law on water transport.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Vongsey Visoth, Permanent Deputy Prime Minister in charge of the Office of the Council of Ministers, on January 17, 2024, at the Office of the Council of Ministers, chaired an inter-ministerial meeting to review and discuss the draft law on water transport. With the participation of Mr. Peng Po Na, Minister of Public Works and Transport and colleagues, as well as representatives of various relevant ministries and institutions.
