During the meeting, the Minister reported on the progress of tourism in Cambodia, including regional and global tourism trends, and highlighted the importance and implementation of the "5 Increase and 3 Development" strategic initiative and other strategic directions. The Ministry of Tourism to promote the development of tourism in 2024 and into the future.
