(Kampong Thom): Major General Som Sun, Commander of Kampong Thom Military Operation Area, President of Kampong Thom Provincial Cambodian Veterans Association, on January 16, 2024, led his colleagues to visit and bring food donations from His Majesty Hun Manet. Vice President of the Cambodian Veterans Association and Lok Chumteav to support the families of veterans living on social land concessions in Dangka village, Kraya commune, Santuk district, Kampong Thom province.
Lt. Gen. Som Sun also brought food donations from Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet and Lok Chumteav Dr. Pich Chanmony to support 12 families of veterans to solve their daily life: 25 rice per family 1 kg of noodles, 2 sticks of fish sauce, 2 sticks of soy sauce and 1 stick of canned fish.
