Dr. Touch Poliva made the remarks on the occasion of leading a joint force to strengthen the administrative control mechanism with vulnerable business owners at Thai Ang Hotel in Bavet Kandal Village, Bavet Sangkat, Bavet City, Svay Rieng Province, starting from the 11th of this month. January 2024.
He added that during the administration at the Thai An Hotel, the specialized force tested the suspects for drugs and found 11 positive people. Two of the 11 females were kept at the hotel. 2 small packets of white powder.
