(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian People's Party, the ruling party in Cambodia, on January 15, 2024, issued a statement firmly recognizing the People's Republic of China as the only legitimate representative of both China. Round.
In a statement obtained by Fresh News, the CPP affirmed that it respects the principles of independence, sovereignty and non-interference in the internal affairs of any country and considers the Taiwan issue to be the internal affairs of the People's Republic of China.
The CPP also adheres to an independent foreign policy based on the law of building good friendship and cooperation between the Kingdom of Cambodia and other countries around the world, in accordance with the principles set out in the UN Charter.
Regarding the recent developments in Taiwan, the Royal Government of Cambodia, through a statement by the spokesperson of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, reaffirmed Cambodia's firm adherence to the "One China Policy" by accepting Recognize the People's Republic of China as the only legitimate authority representing the whole of China.
Labor Minister: 1.5 Million Vocational Training Program Aims to Provide Lifelong Skills to Young People from Poor and Vulnerable Families
This statement was made by the Minister on the occasion of opening a vocational and technical training course for young people from poor and vulnerable families this morning, January 15, 2024, at the National Polytechnic Institute. Cambodian technology.
The Minister continued that the students who enrolled in the school received free education, a monthly stipend of 280,000 Riels, counseling on the selection of skills and labor market information, internships in enterprises, companies, factories as a specialty. Exactly what the job market is looking for and the opportunity to get a decent regular income.
In addition, Mr. Heng Sour added that the training also provided opportunities for informal economic staff and system staff to participate in this vocational and technical training program, which is a bridge for lifelong learning, including exchange programs. Skills increase skills and ability to work, even if they have a job, to implement the program successfully.
He added that this vocational course is not just one course, it has a series of open courses up to 1.5 million people, as long as there are young people enrolled in the Ministry will continue to open, so to ensure that this course is successful. Work and subsequent sessions are more successful.
