(Paris, France): On Monday morning, January 15, 2024, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, opened the French-Cambodian Business Forum organized by the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce.
In this forum, nearly 110 companies came together, including 80 companies from France and 30 groups from Cambodia to exchange relationships, expand opportunities and learn, especially to create investment opportunities in Cambodia.
This business forum will reflect the importance of strengthening bilateral relations between Cambodia and the EU based on the principles of mutual respect, mutual benefit and common values. This important forum will also promote business, investment and trade opportunities, as well as strengthen economic ties between the two sides.
