(Pursat): Pursat Provincial Council held its 7th Ordinary Meeting of the 5th year of the 3rd mandate on the morning of January 15, 2024 at the Provincial Hall under the chairmanship of Mr. Mak Ra, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. Khoy Rida, Provincial Governor, as well as members of the Provincial Council, Deputy Governors, Directors, Deputy Directors of Administration, Provincial Hall, District Governors, Departmental Leaders, 3 Armed Forces Units and many other relevant officials.
