After listening to the agenda and important issues of the members of the Board of Directors of the Departments of District and Municipal Administration Units in the meeting, Mr. Khoy Rida, Provincial Governor, reminded the District / Municipal Administration and relevant departments. Review all past problems, do not leave them alone, mediate and solve them for the people in a timely manner, do not discriminate against partisanship and family.
At the same time, it must strive to develop both knowledge and ability as public representatives, local autonomy, in order to ensure that the performance of its duties and responsibilities to meet the needs of the people in its jurisdiction in an equitable manner. And sustainability to contribute to the Royal Government in reducing poverty.
On that occasion, he also instructed all government officials to continue their efforts to perform more roles and responsibilities in order to serve the interests and needs of the people, focusing on coordinating and solving challenges and services. Prompt, fast and reliable public service is an effective motivator.
