The Royal Government has launched 5 companies / enterprises on the business registration system through the information technology nursery.
(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government has announced the launch of 5 companies / enterprises on the business registration system through the Information Technology Nursery (Single Portal) organized by the inter-ministerial working group to prepare electronic services for the business of Royal Government. This is according to the joint press release.
This process will be done entirely online, with no need for an on-site presence. This achievement is a quick response to the request of the private sector, which the government announced at the 19th Royal Government-Private Sector Forum on November 13, 2023.
