(Phnom Penh): The team of the Center for Digital Education and Distance Education under the leadership of Dr. San Vathana, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports and Chairman of the Secretariat on 12 January 2024 organized a training course for Digital Education Agency to prepare for the campaign to support digital education for students at Phnom Penh Secondary School Season 2.
