The Ambassador of the European Union to Cambodia commends the Cambodian Human Rights Committee for promoting and protecting human rights
This appreciation was made by the Ambassador of the European Union to Cambodia during a meeting between Senior Minister Keo Remy, President of the Cambodian Human Rights Committee, this morning, January 15, 2024, on the occasion of leading the delegation. Polite. The meeting focused on the progress of the work of the Cambodian Human Rights Committee (CCHR) and the cooperation between the CCHR. And the future EU.
