* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that many programs and busy like this, not because of the assistant, but because of the decision of Samdech himself
* Samdech President Hun Manet said that if his meeting with international partners in 15 minutes can attract their investment in Cambodia, Samdech must take the time to meet without worrying about fatigue
