* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that the delegates who came with Samdech were all friendly
* Samdech Mani President Hun Manet reminded of the past overseas mission that attracted hundreds of billions of investors
* President Hun Manet stated that the nearly five months of the new government, with many missions, were just the beginning.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that his official visit to France was special because the French President issued the invitation because there was usually a diplomatic counterpart if the Prime Minister was invited by the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that these days, someone went to explain to the French President, telling Mr. Makrong that he should be careful not to cheat Hun Manet
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the invitation of the President of France will definitely be evaluated from all angles, seeing the benefits of the relationship between the two countries.
* Samdech Hun Manet said that if the French President cheated me, it was over
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that in 2026 we will host Francophonie while Cambodia has already submitted its candidates.
* President Hun Manet questioned those who issued messages wanting the French government not to trust the Cambodian government, what is the benefit to the nation?
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet said that old politicians no longer dare to criticize Samdech as "a politician who has not fallen from his head" because the French President is a few months younger than Samdech
* President Hun Manet said that veteran politicians living in France with dual citizenship should celebrate the current relationship between the Cambodian and French governments.
* Samdech President Hun Manet said that Samdech did not wish the politicians to love Samdech or stop criticizing, but should think that whenever there is a common national interest, we should not harm
Samdech Hun Sen informed Cambodians living in Europe about the important events that took place in the country starting from July 2023, which is the election of the country's leaders.
* Samdech Hun Sen stated that if people do not trust the election, they will not go to the polls in large numbers.
* Samdech Hun Sen stated that the 2023 election and the people walking is a confirmation of the confidence in stability in Cambodia
Samdech Hun Sen thanked Cambodian and Cambodian people in Europe for voting for the Cambodian People's Party
