* Samdech Hun Sen stated that the transfer of power to young people in turn is the previous generation of leaders want to see their achievements for the past 40 years continue to move forward with stability.
* Samdech Hun Sen stated that for almost 5 months, Cambodia has had no situation other than stability and continuous development.
