He added that this is a sharing of his ability and is also a model for all young volunteers to help the suffering in the community. He advised all young people to know how to help each other in this difficult time, proving that this is a culture of sharing true love, and this is a humanitarian work that is shared to help the society, so strive Learn as much as you can and continue to support this humanitarian work.
The family of Mr. Pil Rath and his wife Chey Sinath is very happy to receive a new house and a plot of land and best wishes to Mr. Chea Van Chan and his family.
