Experts state that cryptocurrencies do not have any value that can be determined by a specific mechanism, but the price of a crypto currency can fluctuate greatly depending on the mood of the buyer and investor, the opportunist, or even unsubstantiated information through the network. Society. Therefore, buyers of crypto assets face high risks and may reach a complete loss of money.
The same goes for corporate bond trading options. The price of a bond depends on the interest rate that the company promised at the time of issuance of the bond and on the ability of the company to continue to pay interest. Bonding companies must also be under the control of the same regulatory authority to ensure that business owners can not do anything wrong.
In addition to the comments made by the above experts in an interview with CNBC in November 2023, Dr. Chea Serey, Governor of the National Bank of Cambodia, said that cryptocurrency investors always expect high returns and Quick but obviously there is a lot of negative information about such investments and losses among investors.
"If someone thinks investing in cryptocurrencies is a good option, it may not be a good option for them alone, but that does not mean it is a good option for others or the general public," she said.
