Sok Soeun, 23, was born in Rohal village, Nokor Thom commune, Siem Reap city, Siem Reap province, and Hay Ratha, 31, was born in Sala Kanseng village, Svay Dangkum commune, Siem Reap district and now Run Ta Ek village. Thmey, Run Ta Ek Commune, Banteay Srey District, Siem Reap Province.
According to the confession, on January 11, 2024, at around 2:00 PM, the victim, Nol Samnang, caught seven baby turtles from the waters of Angkor Wat and sold them to guests. No more going back into the water in front of the Angkor Wat school together with two other people, 15-year-old Tinet and 22-year-old Bai Beit, but at 5:30 pm, Nol Samnang sold five baby turtles. 1 head 10,000 Riel) The remaining 2 heads.
At that time, the victim cried incessantly, surprising the tourists, so Sok Soeun shouted, "Heng, did you stop crying?" He walked in front of the victim and slapped the left flower (loudly) and Hay Ratha stopped later while waiting for the car, Hay Ratha walked to the back. The victim then takes the right foot and kicks the victim one more leg.
When the car arrived, they handed over the victim to the environmental officer at the Angkor Landscape Protection Headquarters, located in front of the Angkor Entrance Checkpoint in South Taksin Village, Kork Chak Commune, Siem Reap City, Siem Reap Province.
