Man Arrested in Po Sen Chey District
(Phnom Penh): A suspect was arrested by the police force of Po Sen Chey District Inspectorate while distributing drugs and confiscated along with 8 packages of drugs.
The arrest of the above suspects was made on January 11, 2024 at the point of concrete road, Trapeang Po village, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Sen Chey. According to the police, the suspect, Thun Rithy, 35 years old, is a salesman and currently resides in Trapeang Por village, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Sen Chey.
Prior to the incident, the anti-drug police force of the Po Sen Chey District Police Inspectorate rode motorcycles on patrol in complex areas to prevent various crimes against local people.
When riding to the point of the concrete road in Trapeang Por village, while the police were patrolling, they suddenly found the suspect walking with a suspicious bag, the police checked and found 9 white gram pills. One large package and eight bags were hidden in the suspect's backpack.
After the discovery, the police seized the evidence and brought the suspect to be interrogated and to build a case according to legal procedures. Deputy Governor of Kampong Thom Province: Without Victory Day on January 7, Cambodia would not have complete peace. That no
