Notice! National Institute of Education launches new short courses in 5 majors
(Phnom Penh): The National Institute of Education has informed educators and students who are studying or working in the public and private sectors about the opening of new short courses in 5 majors.
These 5 skills include:
First: Pedagogy and teaching methods Second: Professional specialization Principal 3: Stem education and science experiments Fourth: Secondary library management and Fifth: Education quality assurance inspection system
Note: After completing this course, student educators and students will receive a certificate of completion.
Educators working in the public sector will receive a Continuing Professional Development (CPD) credit.
