Man fabricates motorcycle robbery in Daun Penh district because his wife is angry and does not want to talk to him
(Phnom Penh): A man fabricated the news that he was surprised by a group of motorcycle thieves on the night of January 10, 2024 in the Boeung Kak Lake area in Village 4, Sangkat Srah Chak, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh. Exhausted, the competent authorities open the search overnight until dawn.
He said that after receiving this information, following the order of Lt. Gen. Chuon Narin, Deputy Commissioner and Phnom Penh Municipal Police Commissioner, the criminal force of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police in cooperation with the Khan Police Inspectorate immediately conducted a search since receiving. News until dawn only to find out that the man above fabricated the news.
According to Colonel Sam Vicheka, the police found the motorcycle at a parking lot in a hotel in Srah Chak commune, Daun Penh district, without any robbery.
According to the confession of the person named Ly Roza, he confirmed that he actually fabricated the information of the robber because he wanted his wife to worry about him because he and his wife had an argument and his wife had not spoken to him for three months. The man said that before the incident, he took the motorcycle to the hotel and rode a tricycle around Boeung Kak Lake, then used the can earring cover to injure his head and fabricated a robbery.
However, a spokesman for the Phnom Penh Municipal Police claimed that in this case, the competent force is continuing the legal process because the man fabricated information, causing chaos and affecting social security.
