(Prey Veng): The case of throwing a car package that killed the driver seven months ago, which occurred in Preah Sdach district, Prey Veng province in late April 2023, is now under the command of the provincial police force under the command of General Major Chhoeun Bunchorn, Provincial Commissioner, successfully cracked down with the arrest of two perpetrators.
In this case, after the incident, it is thought that it was a traffic accident, with the victim driving the car falling into a ditch and dying, but the item was actually throwing a car windshield. If the case cannot be broken, the victim will die unjustly and will be hidden forever.
Major General Chhoeun Bunchon said that this was a breakthrough in the case of the provincial police force, which led the operation directly from Brigadier General Pov Chivi, Deputy Commissioner and coordinated by the prosecutor, who worked hard to give up all physical and mental energy. Like taking a boat across the sea to catch on Koh Rong through 5 other provinces and cities until they can be arrested.
The commissioner claimed that, in obedience to the orders of the upper echelons of the force, they had set their sights on the hunt, which began with a complicated case. The other 10 are different cases, but they are partisans of a gang of thugs together, generally speaking, break a nest at once.
The Commissioner General also helped to resolve the civil compensation by calling the families of the victims and the families of the suspects to mediate, receiving compensation of nearly 10 million Riels, while the legal action was decided by the Prey Veng Provincial Court to detain the two suspects. Temporarily, on January 8, 2024.
