Royal Government allows people in 3 areas of Tonle Sap Lake to enjoy temporarily, today, the Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province disseminated to local people
(Kampong Chhnang): Mr. Sun Sovannarith, Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, this morning, January 9, 2024, led a working group to visit Kampong Leng District to meet with the people and disseminate the Royal Government's S.C.N. Some districts that used to enjoy the land in Zone 3 can enjoy the land in Zone 3 for one season temporarily from December 2023 until July 2024.
The Royal Government decided on the following principles:
* Allow people who used to use and enjoy the land in the three areas of Tonle Sap Lake in Kampong Leng district to use the temporary enjoyment for one season from December 2023 to July 2024, requiring a contract with the commune authority Districts and provinces.
* Establish an inter-ministerial working group led by the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to inspect and evaluate the situation of land tenure and actual enjoyment in the land in Area 3 to have sufficient basis to request the facilitation of Zone 3 border to meet the needs of Faces and evolution of society.
* Provincial Unity Command, on behalf of the Provincial State Land Management Committee, must continue to use total force as necessary, with the cooperation of the Natural Resources Crime Suppression Committee and relevant authorities, to enforce the law on those who commit natural resource crimes. To strengthen the management of land in the three flooded forests of the Tonle Sap.
Regarding the above case, Mr. Yem Leakena, Governor of Kampong Leng District, told Fresh News on the morning of January 9, 2024 that the Royal Government's Dissemination Meeting, which took place this morning, January 9, under Presided over by the Governor of Kampong Chhnang Province, there was an invitation from the provincial leaders of the three types of armed forces, including more than 100 people from 9 communes.
The district governor confirmed that according to the content of the Royal Government's above, the people in Kampong Leng district who used to enjoy the land in the past 3 areas can enjoy one season by starting From December 2023 to July 2024, after the harvest, the inter-ministerial working group will visit the actual land area 3 to clearly demarcate the land area 3.
