Samdech Samdech Hun Manet thanked the people for supporting the education reform and the bankruptcy exam.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet Training human resources is the creation of many benefits for the nation.
* President Hun Manet stated that building human capital is an important task.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the Baccalaureate reform has eliminated the culture of intervention and created a culture of self-responsibility.
* President Hun Manet stated that reform is not a revolution by repealing all old policies.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that for successful reform to be based on four factors, including: 1) have a clear vision based on the national interest, 2) high commitment, 3) honest participation and 4) Sacrifice.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that Samdech has signed an agreement with five other ministries to conduct the official recruitment process by following the clear and correct reforms.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that Samdech is highly optimistic in building the nation towards progress, but requires support from all walks of life.
