Mr. Ly Thuch Disseminates the Resolution of the Extraordinary General Assembly of the CPP in Bavet City, Svay Rieng Province
(Svay Rieng): Mr. Ly Thuch, Member of the Central Committee and Chairman of the Bavet Municipal Party Working Group, Representative of Samdech Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Svay Rieng Provincial Party Working Group, disseminated the decision of Extraordinary General Assembly of the Cambodian People's Party.
