(Kampong Cham): Mr. Hang Chuon Naron, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Education and Deputy Chairman of the Local Government Working Group on Kampong Cham Province, said that since the historic victory on January 7, Cambodia has been moving in the right direction in line with the objectives. The sacred wishes of the Cambodian people.
He spoke on the occasion of celebrating the 45th anniversary of the January 7 Victory Day with many other leaders of Kampong Cham province on the morning of January 7, 2024 at the Independence Monument in Kampong Cham.
He said that after the day of liberation on January 7, while rejoicing in the revival of the nation, Cambodia faced countless obstacles and difficulties caused by the threat and attempts to return to the genocidal waste regime. Of the devastating war that is everywhere and the serious consequences in all areas left over from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
"Since the historic victory on January 7, Cambodia has been moving in the right direction in line with the sacred aspirations of the Cambodian people," said Hang Chuon Naron.
He said that despite the difficulties and flexibility, Cambodia is very fortunate to have Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen as the leader to lead the country to unity, territorial unity, peace and stability. And the development of many achievements in all fields.
