Samdech Techo Hun Sen, who risked his life to seize the lives of the people out of Pol Pot's hands, claimed that the January 7 victory restored all the rights and freedoms that were completely lost under the end of the Pol Pot regime. Cambodia's darkest era will usher in a new era of independence, peace, freedom, democracy and social progress.
