He said that His Excellency Hun Manet always thought about the environment and to ensure the safety and hygiene of garbage to avoid infectious diseases to the people of Kampong Thom Provincial Administration has established a large landfill. To transport garbage from Stung Sen city and Kampong Svay district to take care of it with a responsible garbage transport company.
