Mr. Chea Van Chan called on people to know how to pack garbage properly in bags or bags so that garbage companies can collect it cleanly for beauty, and asked all authorities to help promote safety and orderly garbage disposal. Good and know how to put in each section of garbage so as not to infect people through garbage.
