The youngest Prime Minister among the leaders of the other 10 member countries of ASEAN, Samdech Hun Sen, although said that "the job of Prime Minister is equal to the weight of 10 big planes pressing on me." Nevertheless, he is committed to maintaining the old achievements and continuing to innovate in the sense of preserving and developing for the nation and the motherland.
