Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Donate 5 Million Riels and Food to 311 411 Twins
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Chairman of the Supreme Council of the King and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, donated 5 million Riels and some food to the family to give birth to 3 twins (1 girl and 2 boys).
The precious gift of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit was handed over to the above family by Mr. Seng Teang, Deputy Prime Minister of the Cabinet of Samdech Moha Bovathibodi Hun Manet, Prime Minister of Cambodia on Friday morning, January 5, 2024 at rented house No. 10. Abe Street 212, Village 14, Sangkat Phsar Doeum Kor, Khan Toul Kork, Phnom Penh.
The family of triplets is the third child. The father is Bou Kim Yoeun, 34, a private bank employee in Mondulkiri province, and the mother is Mark Malin, 28, who sells clothes. The triplets were born on December 7, 2023 at the National Children's Hospital in Phnom Penh.
The deputy director of the Prime Minister's Cabinet said that all these donations were not donations from the Royal Government, donations from the Cambodian Red Cross or donations from political parties. All these gifts are the gifts born of the sincere and high-mindedness of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, who realized the real difficulties for the people who gave birth to three or four twins.
The families of the above three twins expressed their deepest gratitude to Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit, who always considered the vulnerable people as the personal hardship of both Samdech and Samdech always assigned representatives to bring money and This most valuable material is personally distributed to families who have given birth to triplets to alleviate the difficulties of raising a child to live and have a good future like other citizens in society.
