He said this at the opening ceremony of the meeting to summarize the work results of 2023 and raise the work direction of 2024 of Kampot Provincial Administration on the morning of January 4, 2024 at Kampot Provincial Hall with the participation of Mr. New Saem, Team Leader Provincial councilors as well as leaders of government officials, the armed forces, the authorities and many stakeholders.
