In addition, the Council for the Development of Cambodia pointed out that the number of investment projects in the industrial sector contributed to about 92% of the total investment projects, while about 46% of the investment came from this sector.
In particular, the infrastructure and other sectors, which accounted for only 2.6% of the total investment projects, contributed to about 44% of the total investment capital due to the nature of investment in this sector requires a lot of investment capital. Overall, the flow of private investment in 2023 will increase significantly by around 22% compared to 2022.
