The NEC will hold a meeting with stakeholders to prepare the first voter list for the 5th Senate election on 5 January.
(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) will hold a meeting with stakeholders on the preparation of the first voter list for the 5th Legislative Senate Election 2024 on Friday, January 05, 2024. Coming soon.
According to the announcement received by Fresh News on January 3, 2024, the meeting with stakeholders on the topic:
* Preparation of the initial voter list * Posting of the initial voter list * Complaints or objections and resolution of complaints on the initial voter list
Please be informed that the National Election Committee (NEC) has officially recognized the applications for registration of political parties and the list of candidates for the 5th Legislative Senate Election 2024 of four political parties, including:
First: Cambodian People's Party Second: Khmer Will Party Third: National Forces Party Fourth: FUNCINPEC Party
In accordance with the rules and procedures for the election of senators based on the list of political parties and the official list of candidates, the NEC shall hold a lottery to determine the order of the names of the political parties to be elected. Ballots for which the draw shall be made public by monks or retired dignitaries or elders who are neutral and acceptable to all political parties.
