(Phnom Penh): A Belgian tourist expressed his satisfaction with a trip to Cambodia.
The Belgian tourist spent about two weeks in Cambodia after finishing his tour in Laos. This is the first trip in Cambodia. Visiting Cambodia He received information about the beauty of Cambodia through friends and friends recommended him to visit Cambodia.
For two weeks, he visited Siem Reap, Phnom Penh, Kampot, Kep and Koh Rong, Sihanoukville. After visiting the tourist sites in these provinces, the tourist admired the magnificence of the temples and the beautiful beaches of Cambodia.
The following is an excerpt from a statement from a Belgian tourist:
I am a tourist from Belgium. I came to Cambodia for two weeks. This is the first time in Cambodia. We go to Laos before Cambodia, then we go back home.
In fact, we had some friends who used to come here and they thought it was really nice and then they persuaded us to come to Cambodia.
We went to Siem Reap and now to Kampot, Kep, Phnom Penh and Koh Rong. Then we go back. I think we went to Siem Reap, Angkor Wat is really perfect and really beautiful. We went to Koh Rong and this island is very beautiful because in Belgium we do not have such a beach. It's beautiful nature, beautiful culture.
As for security, yes, it's really good. We feel safe here. So we do not feel that the people here want to steal from us and the people are very friendly both in the guesthouse and elsewhere.
In the restaurant, everyone is really friendly. Like tuk tuk drivers, we use mobile apps so it is all safe. We feel safe here. For the price it is cheaper in Belgium but a little more expensive in Laos. So Cambodia is a bit more expensive than Laos, but for us it is affordable. Yes, it is still good for us. It is not expensive.
We will go to the crab market to eat crabs. I think I have never eaten crab before because it is so expensive in Belgium. Of course, the crab market and the sea as well as this national park are really beautiful. We also saw the monkeys so it was really beautiful.
Yes, of course, because we only went to the north, but we did not go to the east of Cambodia because we did not have enough time, so I do not know what to go for, but maybe we will come back. In the next few years.
Overall, the whole of Asia is really good. It's warm, inexpensive, really nice. Yes, of course, I also think Laos and Cambodia are a good combination. Yes, I would definitely recommend Cambodia to friends and family. Analysis: New Year, new aspects, practical cooperation between China and ASEAN will have a wider future
BEIJING: On the first day of 2024, people from all over the world came together to wish for peace and progress. In his New Year's address, Chinese President Xi Jinping stressed that we are happy to work with the international community to consider the future of humanity and the well-being of the people in order to promote the building of a common destiny of humanity and a better world.
For China and ASEAN, the new year means that political relations between the two sides will be closer, political trust will be higher, the development achievements brought by economic cooperation will be greater. . In particular, 2023 marks the 10th anniversary of the "Belt and Road" initiative and is also a year that bears witness to the development and progress of China and ASEAN.
This is not unlike the speech of Chinese President Xi Jinpin, who said that China not only develops itself but also actively embraces the world, bearing the role of a big country. Things in the world are constantly changing, but peaceful development is always the main task, and win-win cooperation is the most important thing.
Analysis: Over the past 60 years, China has made significant contributions to building a united community of human health.
BEIJING (Xinhua) - The 60th anniversary of the deployment of medical teams abroad in China was recently held in Beijing. China's top leaders have fully recognized the achievements of medical work abroad and encouraged them to "contribute more to promoting the building of a common human health community."
China is now fully advancing modern Chinese-style modernization. As the world's largest developing country, while always focusing on its own development, China has always been committed to helping other developing countries achieve modernization through its development. Body. In particular, medical assistance provided by China to foreign countries is an important sector.
