Under a win-win policy with Samdech Techo Hun Sen as the founder and leader, Cambodia has put an end to the flames of war, found peace, especially the dark pages of national disintegration in at least 500 years. . Starting from peace and complete national unity on December 29, 1998, it is a great cause for Cambodia to achieve national construction so that its people can live as happily as they do today.
The Khmer Economic Development Party would like to fully support the words of His Excellency Hun Manat in making December 29 a day of peace in Cambodia. Samdech's words show the world more clearly that Cambodia is a country full of peace, independence, territorial integrity, sovereignty, step forward in the field of national development, economy, people and society.
The Khmer Economic Development Party strongly hopes that this Peace Day can be a strong force for the benefit of all Cambodians, shifting from a political point of view, overthrowing and attacking each other, stepping on the development sector, both human resources and democratic economic resources like To other countries that are developing globally.
