Mr. Uy Ry, Chairman of Battambang Provincial Council, had a very meaningful talk and encouragement in disseminating education on various issues related to drugs, urging all victims to try to listen to the education of all professional teachers. Part to speed recovery back to family and community.
After preaching the word of Jesus Christ, the Christian Church Network Council donated 310 Bibles, 750 kg of rice, 750 kg of soy sauce, 10 ounces of fish sauce, and 3 ounces to the Center for Rehabilitation and Rehabilitation. Verse 10 carry and 10 cases of noodles.
Mr. Ke Sinuon, President of the Center, thanked and welcomed all the organizations and charitable organizations that wish to help the children of all drug victims at the Center for Drug Treatment and Rehabilitation. Ke Sinuon drug, Battambang.
The program ended with joy in the presence of Jesus Christ, the Prince of Salvation.
BEIJING, Dec. 27 (Xinhua) - The Central China Foreign Affairs Conference was held in Beijing on December 27-28. Xi Jinping, Secretary-General of the CPC Central Committee, President of the People's Republic of China and Chairman of the CPC Central Military Commission, attended the meeting and delivered a keynote speech.
Xi Jinping systematically summed up the historic achievements and valuable experiences of China's diplomacy, a major feature of China in the new era, and gave an in-depth description of the international environment and the historical mission facing Chinese diplomacy. In the new journey, as well as comprehensive management of China's diplomacy now and in the future.
The conference noted that since the 18th CPC National Congress, in the process of promoting the socialist cause of China in the new era, China's foreign affairs work has achieved historic achievements and changed history.
The conference stressed that over the past 10 years, we have overcome difficulties and challenges in foreign affairs, and China has become a more responsible and influential country in the international arena. By innovation and fairness.
The conference noted that looking to the future, China's development is facing new strategic opportunities. We need to focus on the core task of the party and the state in shaping the relationship between China and the world in order to make China more influential internationally.
