(Ratanakkiri): Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, Governor of Ratanakkiri Province, issued an order to dismiss Dr. Ong Ratana from the position of Director of the Department of Health to work as an official at the Provincial Referral Hospital.
At the same time, the provincial governor assigned Mr. Chea Sanit, the current Deputy Director of the Department of Health, to hold the temporary position of acting Director of the Department of Health of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Administration.
