(Phnom Penh): On Friday, December 29, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, presided over the celebration of the 25th anniversary of the end of the year. The Cambodian Civil War and the successful implementation of the win-win politics and the five-year anniversary of the construction of the Victory Monument.
The following are the keynote speeches of Samdech President Hun Manet on the occasion of celebrating the 25th anniversary of the end of the Cambodian Civil War under the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* President Hun Manet stated that the celebration of the anniversary of the end of the civil war in Cambodia and the successful implementation of the win-win policy is an invaluable historical event.
* Samdech Hun Sen highly praised all the armed forces for their strong support of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's win-win policy.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the construction of a win-win political monument is a preservation of valuable historical evidence and for the next generation of Cambodians.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the construction of a win-win political monument has been carefully considered and strived for. Without high commitment, this monument could not be built.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the win-win political monument highlighted the events in Cambodia from the stage of progress to destruction and towards progress again.
* President Hun Manet stated that a win-win policy could not be achieved without a loyal operator joining Samdech Techo.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that only one brigade can ignite the flames of war. But ending the war requires the participation of all parties.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that the win-win political monument is a symbol of all Cambodians and a symbol of peace. So this monument was built for all Cambodians.
* President Hun Manet stated that the compilation of historical events and journeys of Cambodia is very important for Cambodian travel.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet instructed the working group of the Win-Win Political Monument to continue carving all the events and achievements of Cambodia at the Win-Win Political Monument.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the key element that leads to the successful implementation of win-win politics is confidence.
* President Hun Manet stated that the trust was the trust of Samdech Techo and the Khmer Rouge Army believed in its decision.
* President Hun Manet stated that if the war in Cambodia did not end, how many more people would die.
* President Hun Manet stated that the end of the war gave Cambodia the opportunity to develop, including the former battlefields.
* President Hun Manet stated that the end of the war contributed to maintaining regional stability.
* President Hun Manet stated that the end of the war brought about national unity, gathering strength and intelligence to build the nation.
* President Hun Manet stated that the end of the war creates opportunities to create opportunities for future generations. This is a huge benefit.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised to continue research related to the process of finding peace and ending the war in Cambodia.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet advised to continue to disseminate the content of the win-win policy.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet advised to continue to build Victory Monument and organize military historical sites in key areas.
