(Kep): Dr. Ly Thuch, Senior Minister and First Vice President of the Mines Authority, said that the 7th mandate government, which has just been more than 4 months old, is highly valued by the international community for its achievements and achievements and continues to support it. To the efforts and policies to lead the country to more progress of the Prime Minister Hun Manet, including the field of mine action in Cambodia.
