He added that in connection with demining work in 2023, Cambodia has set out a plan to clear 356 square kilometers of land, the largest annual plan in 30 years since 1992. At the same time, Cambodia has become a leader and is considered a model country in the world for successful leadership in the field of mine action.
These achievements stem from the invaluable peace values of former Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen and will continue to fully and resolutely support mine action by 2025 for his seventh term government. His Excellency Hun Manet, Prime Minister.
After achieving the goal of Cambodia Mine Action 2025, the Mine Authority has many other tasks, including the preparation of a long-term strategic plan for the two main areas of mine action in Cambodia, including the first /. Preparation of a national policy on mine action and secondly / Support the preparation of a national strategic plan for mine action after 2025.
