Please be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia, the 7th legislature, has decided to appoint Mr. Dith Tina, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, as the Chairman of the Working Group of the Royal Government of Banteay Meanchey Province, according to the Decision No. 206 Pillar dated 30 November 2023. A total of 122 national bases.
