The glorious decade of Chinese wisdom empowers human beings to achieve common dreams
BEIJING, March 23 (Xinhua) - Ten years ago, starting with the departure of Chinese wisdom on community building, the common destiny of humanity was highlighted in Chinese President Xi Jinping's speech on March 23, 2013. Is making great strides in the spirit of world leaders for the spirit of participating in finding global solutions to the world's problems.
This Chinese wisdom emerged at a very opportune time, helping to curb any risks that the world is concerned about, a return to the Cold War or the possibility of a unilateral mechanism or a return to democracy. Colonial or patriarchal form.
In fact, the Chinese side has been paying close attention to the current situation around Syria to reduce the risk of danger in the region, and the Chinese side has always called on the international community, especially the superpowers, should play a constructive role in preventing Conflicts occur and encourage all parties involved to remain calm and tolerant, avoiding any possible actions that will aggravate the situation.
Overall, as the Chinese wisdom on community building, the common destiny of mankind, enters a new decade, all human beings have a deeper understanding of the Chinese wisdom with a common dream to build a partnership that provides win-win cooperation. And achieve the common aspiration of the development of peace, prosperity, equality and justice flourishing around the world.
