Samdech Hun Manet reminded that the location of the sewage development project in Phnom Penh, if you look at Meli in the past, this area, and when it comes to Tuol Sleng prison and Choeung Ek Lake, probably all people can imagine the skeletons of the victims. Who were killed inside the Khmer Rouge killing field.
