(Svay Rieng): Mr. Peng Pursa, Governor of Svay Rieng Province and Chairman of the Provincial Administrative Unity Command, instructed the relevant government officials to inspect and prohibit all illegal slums.
The provincial governor said this during a meeting to review the work results for December 2023 and the work direction for January 2024 of Svay Rieng Provincial Administration on the morning of December 26.
