He advised the task force to continue to strengthen the enforcement of road traffic laws, prevention and effective drug trafficking.
He added that the municipal authorities must cooperate with the provincial Department of Land Management, Urban Planning, Construction and Cadastral Affairs to conduct land surveys for people, especially on Saturdays and Sundays, which are workers' holidays.
He further instructed the authorities to inform the people and take action against the cattle that have been left unattended along National Road No. 1 in Svay Rieng province to avoid endangering road users.
